OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe day will stay mostly dry
OL,6,Fand after a mainly cloudy start to the
OL,7,Fmorning, bright or sunny spells will
OL,8,Fincrease at times. A few showers will
OL,9,Fbuild in the north and east towards
OL,10,Fthe evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear spells in the south at
OL,13,Ffirst otherwise mostly cloudy with
OL,14,Fscattered showers in the north and
OL,15,Fwest for a time in the late evening.
OL,16,FClear spells and frosty later.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FMost places dry with bright
OL,19,For sunny spells and a frosty start to
OL,20,Fthe morning. Cloudy with a few showers
OL,21,Fin the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
