OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLess
OL,6,Fcold from Friday. Mostly cloudy, dry
OL,7,FFriday and Saturday, an odd shower in
OL,8,Fthe far west. Rain in the north at
OL,9,Ffirst Sunday, otherwise mostly cloudy
OL,10,Fbut dry.
